text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"下载后强制校验 sha256，失败即停止，不会落盘；"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"解压时拒绝 `..`、绝对路径、符号链接、大小写冲突、Windows 保留名；"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"单包上限 50MB，解压后 200MB，最多 2000 个文件；"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"安装先落到 `plugins/.staging/<id>/`，校验通过后才改名到 `plugins/<id>/`\n或 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`；目标已存在时拒绝覆盖。"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"page","content":"调用 TDLib","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"td_invoke、请求号与 response 通道、便捷封装"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号与 response 通道"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名以 TDLib 为准"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"便捷封装：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"等到什么才返回"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"回调里用 `*_then`"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"最小上手"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-7","page_id"